erver 已停止维护且不再有安全更新，建议立即迁移至 vsftpd 或 ProFTPD 等受支持的文件传输服务。若无法更换，须在防火墙层面限制该 FTP 服务的源 IP 白名单访问，并部署 IPS 规则拦截超长 USER 命令的流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94121377716133&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=94130292519646&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/749","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3401","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5dccbdd02e04ed15263189c9e9adec0bd125446a/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1514.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1514","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1514.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/33dc7d7c01654661dd82814415270cb51d2d0728/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1514.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db7261396795ee10e4834f0fdf94aec36b0936ff/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-87hw-jg6c-ggf2/GHSA-87hw-jg6c-ggf2.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/749/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151700_151800.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1514.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7ab4292b-6860-4a16-8474-66e7c991e0ac.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/d1321841542ad681aa90ebf69f41b355bb7e4c9b/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1144.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0877","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0877.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1024","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1728,\"inputTokens\":9101,\"outputTokens\":24,\"totalTokens\":10853}}","description":"LBL tcpdump 3.4a 版本的 ip_print 处理函数存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过发送零长度头部的特制数据包，触发 tcpdump 在打印数据包时陷入无限循环并导致核心转储，从而实施拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响 LBL tcpdump 3.4a 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，属高危漏洞。攻击者无需认证即可远程发送恶意数据包触发漏洞，导致 tcpdump 进程崩溃并产生核心转储文件，造成服务拒绝。ExploitDB 已公开相关利用代码（tcpdump 3.4 - Protocol Four / Zero Header Length）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1024"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-11-28T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:32Z","remediation":"建议将 LBL tcpdump 升级至 3.4a7 及以上修复版本（或迁移至 tcpdump 3.5 以上版本），该版本修复了 ip_print 对零长度头部数据包的无限循环缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在抓包主机的前端防火墙或路由器上过滤畸形 IP 包，并避免在非信任网络接口上以 root 权限运行 tcpdump 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92955903802773&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92963447601748&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92989907627051&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/313","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19251","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7e65fa522cff0172990568230ff9b719b8650296/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1024.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1024","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1024.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7aedbd0209e609a1924ad29a8dda684737576137/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1024.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5d945305f2cad48b7bb06af582393a58c31555d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4xf9-whrj-cqwc/GHSA-4xf9-whrj-cqwc.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1024.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151700_151800.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a2475725-573a-44a3-9fee-e5b8ed92fad2.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0877.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0877.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0877.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1191","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1191.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1569","title":"id Software Quake 1.9 UDP 泛洪拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Id Software Quake 1 及 NetQuake 服务器存在 UDP Flooding 拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过伪造大量 UDP 连接数据包向服务器发起洪水攻击，使服务器连接数超过设定的玩家上限，导致服务器资源耗尽或强制断开所有玩家连接。该漏洞利用无需认证，攻击门槛低，直接严重危害游戏服务可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1569"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-07-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:44Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用遗留的 NetQuake 服务端，升级至 QuakeWorld 或现代开源移植版（如 QuakeSpasm、DarkPlaces、FTEQW），这些版本已从协议层修复 UDP 连接泛洪问题。如无法升级，可在防火墙层面限制 UDP 连接速率（例如 iptables 针对 26000/UDP 端口设置 `--limit 5/s`），并设置服务端 `sv_maxplayers` 参数限制最大玩家数，同时部署入侵检测规则监控异常 UDP 连接请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221101925989&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91012172524181&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/197268","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3051","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6871","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21012","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4f761f58350f835cb02025d033f6f8c7f536e6b7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999