E-2001-0241"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:56Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-023 对应的补丁程序，或升级至 Windows 2000 Service Pack 3 及以上版本。如无法安装补丁，可在 IIS 管理器中删除 .printer 脚本映射或禁用 Internet 打印服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98874912915948&w=2","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-10.html","http://www.osvdb.org/3323","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2674","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-023","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6485","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A1068","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/268","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2001/CVE-2001-0241.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0241.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0241","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0241.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0241.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-33qj-cxq7-xmmr/GHSA-33qj-cxq7-xmmr.json","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/cve_2_MSF_exploit_Mapping/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/KvasirSecurity/Kvasir/blob/a5b3775184a8343240e1154a1f762f75df04dc0a/static/etc/canvas_exploits.xml","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/df98cd885e49b66ef39b05ac11ddad1b492edabf/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt","https://github.com/gadievron/raptor/blob/4238dca8fa0c9908e40b107c60a4bd8916643d2d/packages/cve_diff/data/samples/random_200_full_v3.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1562.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1562.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1562.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0739","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0739.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0945","title":"Microsoft Exchange Server Internet Mail Service 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Exchange Server 5.0 和 5.5 的 Internet Mail Service (IMS) 组件中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器的 25 端口发送特制的 AUTH 或 AUTHINFO 命令，触发 IMS 在处理这些命令时的缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Exchange Server 5.0 和 5.5 版本，攻击者只需能够与目标建立 SMTP 连接即可实施攻击，利用门槛较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0945"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:22Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft Exchange 5.5 Post-Service Pack 2 安全汇总更新，或升级至受支持的 Exchange Server 2016/2019 版本。如无法立即升级，可在网络防火墙或 Exchange 前端限制对 SMTP 端口 (25/TCP) 的 AUTH/AUTHINFO 命令访问，仅允许可信来源发起认证请求，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ169174","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/i-080.shtml","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise4.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1223","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58316128f65d22a226717ff1f92ebf2058e46bc6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0945.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0945","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-0945.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4d2ed764072119c12b6f84e6ee4e0df62586a8c4/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0945.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/95e6ff620d5494b93ba2234edfcf6a45187dc0a8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hc7r-j3rx-qwm2/GHSA-hc7r-j3rx-qwm2.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0945.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e92d734d-18ef-4134-bc77-7d094168d3b9.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0739.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0724","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0724.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0924","title":"Allaire ColdFusion Server 4.0 Syntax Checker 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Allaire ColdFusion Server 4.0 的 Syntax Checker 组件存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器发送特制的恶意请求触发该漏洞，导致 Syntax Checker 进程崩溃或消耗大量系统资源，从而使 ColdFusion 服务无法正常响应合法用户请求。该漏洞影响 ColdFusion Server 4.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。厂商已发布安全更新修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0924"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:20Z","remediation":"建议升级至 ColdFusion 4.0.1 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层面限制对 Syntax Checker 相关路径（如 /cfide/Administrator/）的访问，仅允许可信 IP 来源，或禁用不必要的 ColdFusion 管理功能以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=8739&Method=Full","http://www.osvdb.org/3236","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1742","https://git